1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,676
ProofGate helps employees use AI while keeping company records and decision rules on a trusted company-controlled host.

2
00:00:05,676 --> 00:00:10,497
Our example is supplier renewals: who should we negotiate with, and what price should we ask for?

3
00:00:10,497 --> 00:00:15,973
The employee gives a public instruction: choose at most two renewals within sixty days, earliest first.

4
00:00:15,973 --> 00:00:22,482
The company keeps supplier quotes, current prices, service scores, and its decision rules in a separate private worksheet.

5
00:00:22,482 --> 00:00:28,540
Compose AI method starts actual hosted AI. It chooses a plan from approved operations, rather than arbitrary code.

6
00:00:28,540 --> 00:00:34,668
The plan selects renewals, applies price rules, ranks suppliers, limits the selection, and renders a brief.

7
00:00:34,668 --> 00:00:40,128
ProofGate checks the public instruction and the proposed method using deterministic controls and enabled AI inspection.

8
00:00:40,128 --> 00:00:46,251
Only an admitted method can execute locally. Policy, permissions, and a shared finite allowance govern the workflow.

9
00:00:46,251 --> 00:00:52,314
The local executor applies that method to private company data and produces selected suppliers and negotiation price ceilings.

10
00:00:52,314 --> 00:00:58,938
This recorded example changed from Near and Middle to Middle and Large. These amounts are potential opportunities, not achieved savings.

11
00:00:58,938 --> 00:01:05,422
On the website, Try a private quote change adds one hundred dollars, applies the records, and recomputes the same method locally.

12
00:01:05,422 --> 00:01:12,290
The brief can change without new provider attempts. Rebind locally performs this recomputation; it does not ask AI for another plan.

13
00:01:12,290 --> 00:01:16,573
Open Actual planner and checker application bodies to inspect what the remote models received.

14
00:01:16,573 --> 00:01:23,505
The captured bodies contain public intent and capabilities, but exclude private records, rule bodies, and the calculated brief.

15
00:01:23,505 --> 00:01:29,528
Attempt external export is a manual refusal test. Save exact internal brief is a separate employee-approved action.

16
00:01:29,528 --> 00:01:35,821
An independent read-back verifies the saved result. The slide shows earlier evidence; opening the website makes no new save.

17
00:01:35,821 --> 00:01:41,605
This is a synthetic prototype with hosted AI and a trusted company host, not a universal security guarantee.

18
00:01:41,605 --> 00:01:47,949
The website opens a retained AI method. Compose starts new inference; changing private data and rebinding reuse that method.

19
00:01:47,949 --> 00:01:53,256
The employee asks. AI composes an approved method. Company facts determine the useful result.

20
00:01:53,256 --> 00:01:57,857
ProofGate makes the boundary, budget, decisions, and permitted actions inspectable.
